    "title": "Data-Driven Ethics and Systems Change",
    "description": "An innovative course that transforms traditional ethics education by integrating data science, systems thinking, and advocacy strategies to address the most harmful industries and behaviors in modern society. Students learn to measure harm, analyze complex systems, identify leverage points, and design effective interventions.",
